# Ruling 2023-11-10: "If a card that isn't a transforming double-faced card is a copy of Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal, it
# won't return to the battlefield when it dies." Bot2's Phantasmal Image copies Bot1's Aclazotz on turn 2 and has Aclazotz's
# dies ability; Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets the Image, whose own ability sacrifices it. The copy's trigger finds the card in
# the graveyard but Phantasmal Image has no back face, so it stays there (CR 712.14a). Bot1's own Aclazotz is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Phantasmal Image
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island x13

